abstract: >
  Anchor Ω (Ω₁₀ Core) is a symbolic override framework designed by Dr. C 
  to tag, encode, and recursively trace epistemic node structures within constrained symbolic logic systems.
  Integrated with modular support (Mirror-Dance, RLHF-Bypass, Containment Class A–F, Trust Ladder), 
  it enables audit-safe symbolic recursion and containment logic evolution.

